"height":29}]},{"text":"다음에는 트리 집합에 새로운 정점 u가 추가되었으~므로 u에 인접한 정점 v들의 distance 값","words":[{"text":"다음에는","x":180,"y":1622,"width":110,"height":29},{"text":"트리","x":300,"y":1622,"width":51,"height":29},{"text":"집합에","x":366,"y":1621,"width":77,"height":30},{"text":"새로운","x":456,"y":1622,"width":79,"height":28},{"text":"정점","x":547,"y":1622,"width":47,"height":30},{"text":"u가","x":606,"y":1621,"width":42,"height":30},{"text":"추가되었으~므로","x":657,"y":1621,"width":177,"height":30},{"text":"u에","x":844,"y":1622,"width":40,"height":30},{"text":"인접한","x":898,"y":1621,"width":76,"height":30},{"text":"정점","x":985,"y":1621,"width":49,"height":30},{"text":"v들의","x":1046,"y":1621,"width":66,"height":30},{"text":"distance","x":1126,"y":1624,"width":115,"height":23},{"text":"값","x":1252,"y":1620,"width":28,"height":30}]},{"text":"을 변경시켜준다. 즉 기존의 distance[v) 값보다 간선 (벽 v)의 가중치 값이 적으면 간선 (비","words":[{"text":"을","x":147,"y":1673,"width":29,"height":29},{"text":"변경시켜준다.","x":187,"y":1673,"width":168,"height":30},{"text":"즉","x":370,"y":1675,"width":27,"height":27},{"text":"기존의","x":408,"y":1672,"width":75,"height":30},{"text":"distance[v)","x":496,"y":1676,"width":148,"height":26},{"text":"값보다","x":659,"y":1672,"width":75,"height":30},{"text":"간선","x":743,"y":1673,"width":49,"height":29},{"text":"(벽","x":805,"y":1672,"width":29,"height":32},{"text":"v)의","x":846,"y":1672,"width":47,"height":31},{"text":"가중치","x":905,"y":1672,"width":74,"height":31},{"text":"값이","x":993,"y":1673,"width":49,"height":29},{"text":"적으면","x":1056,"y":1673,"width":77,"height":29},{"text":"간선","x":1144,"y":1672,"width":52,"height":30},{"text":"(비","x":1209,"y":1672,"width":31,"height":31}]},{"text":"의 기중치값으로 dist[v]를 변경시킨다. Q에 있는 모든 정점들이 소진될 때까지 이것을 되풀이","words":[{"text":"의","x":149,"y":1724,"width":23,"height":28},{"text":"기중치값으로","x":186,"y":1723,"width":164,"height":31},{"text":"dist[v]를","x":360,"y":1724,"width":127,"height":29},{"text":"변경시킨다.","x":499,"y":1723,"width":132,"height":30},{"text":"Q에","x":64